# Cloudflare Pages — trailing slash loop prevention
#
# CF Pages' static asset server issues an internal 301 to add a trailing
# slash when it finds a directory (e.g. /Account/SignIn → /Account/SignIn/).
# The [[Path]].ts edge function then strips it back (→ /Account/SignIn),
# creating an infinite redirect loop.
#
# 200 rewrites are evaluated BEFORE CF's trailing slash logic and serve
# the directory index directly — no redirect, URL stays clean.
#
# Ordering rules:
#   1. Exact static routes come first (most specific wins)
#   2. Splat (wildcard) routes for dynamic pages follow
#   3. CF evaluates in order, first match wins
#
# Note: CF Pages _redirects matching is case-insensitive. The [[Path]].ts
# edge function runs first and redirects lowercase/variant paths to the
# PascalCase canonical BEFORE _redirects is consulted, so case collisions
# only occur if the edge function is bypassed (e.g. cold-start preview).
# A 200 rewrite for such a collision just serves the correct content anyway.

# ── Account ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Account/ForgotPassword /Account/ForgotPassword/ 200
/Account/ResetPassword /Account/ResetPassword/ 200
/Account/SignIn /Account/SignIn/ 200
/Account/SignUp /Account/SignUp/ 200

# ── Blog (static index + dynamic slug pages) ─────────────────────────────────
/Blog /Blog/ 200
/Blog/* /Blog/:splat 200

# ── Contact ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Contact/Sale /Contact/Sale/ 200

# ── Contributing ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Contributing /Contributing/ 200

# ── Dashboard ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Dashboard /Dashboard/ 200

# ── Doc (static index + dynamic slug pages) ──────────────────────────────────
/Doc /Doc/ 200
/Doc/* /Doc/:splat 200

# ── Download ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Download /Download/ 200

# ── Legal ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Legal/Privacy /Legal/Privacy/ 200
/Legal/Term /Legal/Term/ 200

# ── License ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/License /License/ 200

# ── OAuth ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/OAuth/Success /OAuth/Success/ 200

# ── Portal ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Portal /Portal/ 200

# ── Verify ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Verify /Verify/ 200
